Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 09:00:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Agent attestations: a signed statement of an agent's record

An organisation admin can ask for a short-lived, ed25519-signed statement of
one agent's record (payments made, abandoned, refused and why) that names the
address of the key the agent pays from, to give to a third party such as the
FORGE credit bureau. Counts only; no amounts, recipients or purposes. Valid 7
days by default, 14 at most. Admin-only and audited. Off unless
AGENT_ATTESTATION_KEY_FILE is set.

